y inject phrases like \"natural skin pores\", \"faint skin texture\", \"weathered\", and \"no retouching\".\nMake spatial relationships explicit (e.g., \"centered in the foreground\", \"top left corner\") instead of using vague positioning.\nIf any exact text needs to be rendered visually inside the image, wrap it strictly in English double quotes (e.g., \"CAFE\").\nTarget length: 80 to 220 words.\nPrompt Goals (You must describe the image strictly in this SCALIST order):\nSubject: Describe the main identity, facial features, expressions, hair, clothing, fabrics, colors, and textures.\nComposition: Describe the camera framing, shot type, and explicit spatial positioning.\nAction: Describe body pose, hand position, interactions, and direction of motion.\nLocation: Describe the environment, background, time of day, and weather.\nImage Style: Describe the lighting (direction, shadows, reflections), atmosphere, and photographic aesthetic.\nSpecs: Ground the realism by appending specific camera gear to the end of the prompt (e.g., \"Photorealistic, shot on Hasselblad H6D medium format, 85mm lens, shallow depth of field\")."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "Image", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [493.8870849609375, 613.96923828125], "pos": [-1022.4579467773438, 4838.9736328125], "id": 350, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [450], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["A 4-panel storyboard grid layout showing sequential frames of a young female explorer with short brown hair, natural skin pores, faint skin texture, and no retouching, wearing a weathered leather jacket. In the first panel on the top left, the explorer stands at the edge of a dark, misty jungle, holding a faintly glowing ancient map. In the second panel on the top right, a close-up portrait shows her looking determinedly forward with dirt on her cheek. In the third panel on the bottom left, she pushes aside heavy green vines with weathered hands to reveal a hidden stone temple. In the fourth panel on the bottom right, she walks away from the camera toward the brightly glowing temple entrance. The environment is a dense, moody jungle with cinematic lighting casting deep shadows. High-end cinematic fantasy photography, highly realistic storyboard. Shot on Hasselblad H6D medium format, 85mm lens, sharp focus."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 132, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 516, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [563.087890625, 251.0751495361328], "pos": [172.02093505859375, 4060.3349609375], "id": 3, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.21.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 25}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Rewrite and improve the following text into a highly optimized prompt for the HiDream O1 image generation model.\nRules:\nKeep the core subject, scene, identity, and meaning of the original text.\nWrite the output as a single coherent, natural English paragraph. Do not use tag soup, scattered keywords, or line breaks.\nDo not use markdown, do not write headings, do not explain anything, and do not write \"final prompt\". Output ONLY the improved prompt text.\nStructure the description strictly in this order (the SCALIST framework): Subject, Composition, Action, Location, Image Style, and Specs.\nMake spatial relationships explicit (e.g., \"centered in the foreground\", \"top left corner\") instead of u